and brief nudity.

00:12:01.453 --> 00:12:04.056
Okay, I'm not seeing
a lot of hands for fractals."

00:12:04.056 --> 00:12:05.523 line:0%
Of course,
it won't shock you to learn

00:12:05.523 --> 00:12:07.492 line:0%
that Republicans don't actually
have any convincing,

00:12:07.492 --> 00:12:09.894 line:0%
principled arguments
against D.C. statehood,

00:12:09.894 --> 00:12:10.896
