00:12:10.896 --> 00:12:11.930
They act like there have been

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:14.866
exactly 50 states
in the Union since 1776,

00:12:14.866 --> 00:12:16.068
which, obviously,
isn't the case.

00:12:16.068 --> 00:12:18.504
In fact, rural states
have done this same thing

00:12:18.504 --> 00:12:20.639
