their own political power.

00:12:50.969 --> 00:12:53.238
Exactly. You think the framers
envisioned, not one,

00:12:53.238 --> 00:12:55.307
but two Dakotas when they
wrote the Constitution?

00:12:55.307 --> 00:12:57.676
Those dorks barely knew
where the Dakotas were.

00:12:57.676 --> 00:13:00.011
Back then, they just rode
one horse until it died

00:13:00.011 --> 00:13:01.980
