00:13:14.159 --> 00:13:15.627
[ Posh accent ]
No, I moved to Philadelphia.

00:13:15.627 --> 00:13:17.495
[ Boston accent ]
Oh, he moved to Philly.
Alright, bro,

00:13:17.495 --> 00:13:19.598
