00:13:19.598 --> 00:13:21.066
[ Posh accent ]
I invented electricity!

00:13:21.066 --> 00:13:23.269
[ Boston accent ]
Well, I invented
I don't [bleep] care!

00:13:23.269 --> 00:13:24.636
[ Laughter ]

00:13:24.636 --> 00:13:25.704
Where were we?

00:13:25.704 --> 00:13:27.205
Oh, right, present day.

00:13:27.205 --> 00:13:29.508
In fact, Republicans have
so few legitimate arguments

00:13:29.508 --> 00:13:30.809
that, last month,
